     "tex": "n(\\text{Mg}) = \\dfrac{100\\ \\text{g}}{24\\ \\text{g mol}^{-1}} = 4.17\\ \\text{mol}",
     "caption": "mass to moles"
    },
    {
     "type": "faded_example",
     "title": "Mole-mass (Ex. 4.6)",
